      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ORSON BOB (1) is a Michael Clayton-trained newcomer by Orson Allen out of Culpable Model. Drawn well and should get his chance. Profiles strongly and pay to watch the market closely. ONE HOT CHANCE (4) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Addy's Girl (20.30) in a Maiden. Has the pace to be prominent. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Expected to be in this for a long way. MANTON ROAD (8) finished midfield on debut when fourth (21.41) at Nowra over 365m. Can find the frame this time. BOONA ROAD (7) made it two minor placings on the trot when beaten second (20.14) in a Maiden at this track last time out.",
